WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Heavily holding the freedom

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Choosing the invisible path

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
We wander into the light

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.970
11th Day of the 4th month, Keio 4

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:26.080
Kanei Shrine in Ueno

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:59.980
On this day, the final Tokugawa Shogun
left for Mito, and a long era came to an end.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:06.620
However, the beginning of
a new era was still far away.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.690
<i>SHO</i>

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:11.690
The era was still very much in chaos.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.200
The Shogitai

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.570
On that day, the famous tactician
Masujiro Omura,

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:37.060
Masujiro Omura

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:37.610
also known as "Fire-Breathing Daruma"
for his unique facial appearance,

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.820
was meeting with Saigo.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.050
There was only one agenda of this meeting:

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.020
The attack on Ueno.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:51.040
Then send Satsuma Province's forces
to the front line of the attack at the Kuro Gate.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.230
I don't care if it gets us all killed.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.530
Will that do, Masujiro-dono?

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:57.910
Yes.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:02.340
Then the Choshu forces
can all reroute towards Hongo.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.610
Indeed.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.060
Yokohama

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:32.300
Would you like a ride to Edo?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.610
Thank you very much.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:39.850
Oryo

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:41.250
But it seems that the address of the person
that I'm looking for is in this town.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:56.730
The Head of the Conqueror has not
been sealed yet due to those events.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.960
Now that it's come to this, I have no choice
but to follow through with my mission.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:05.670
Therefore until I complete my mission,
I won't be able to return to the village.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:11.810
But before that, there's one thing
I absolutely must know.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.970
It's truly over now.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.440
Yes, it is.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:44.710
I wonder what that was...

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.640
The Head of the Conqueror...

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:50.560
Both the master and Akizuki-sama
were after it from the beginning,

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:57.390
so I guess it was the cause of it all,
but now both of them are gone.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:49.880
He helped us get our revenge and
he saved us many times, too.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.710
We're in no place to complain.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.480
Why don't I make some tea?

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.610
I'll do it.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:01.930
Where's everyone?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.220
Kakashi is working at the port.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.030
Here you go.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.290
It's hot!

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.750
Here you go.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:37.990
Welcome!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.920
Thank you for your business as always.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:45.470
I'm here again, Tayu, I mean, "Mama".

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:51.970
What?

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:53.900
Hurry up and take my order!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:58.280
Okay. What would you like?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.310
Mistress!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.280
You're supposed to call her "Mama" here.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:02.940
Oh, Mama!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.920
Yes, right away!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.960
It's too bad...

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.660
This place!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:05.450
Shinsengumi Team 1 Leader
Soji Okita

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.380
The enemy of the Imperial Palace, Soji Okita!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:12.980
How many comrades of mine have you
killed with your filthy sword?

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.740
Okita!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:32.570
Even if you get us now, sooner or later
my comrades will get you!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.940
Just like they did with Kondo!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.670
What did you just say? Commander...

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.030
You traitor!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.760
Sensei...

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.130
He is...

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.770
No way...

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:09.510
I won't let you commit seppuku!
I'll treat you like a traitor!

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:45.910
You are...

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.080
Akizuki!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.950
It has been a long time, Mr. Okita.

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:02.170
Sato Dojo in Tama

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.500
Fast!

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:11.870
It's too fast!

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.680
Soji Okita's Three Strikes.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.710
He's a master of Tennen Rishin style.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:20.310
Next!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.650
Next!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.950
Who's next?

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:27.860
No one?

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.160
I'll be the next!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.300
Oryo-san?!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.470
Y-Yes...

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:51.340
"Oryo"...you're Ryoma Sakamoto's
woman? The real one?!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.350
Miss Leader, I've heard that you played as me.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:10.820
30th day of the 4th month, Keio 4

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:17.060
Edo

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:21.040
Hurry up! Don't you slow down!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.200
Katsu-sensei!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.470
So you're back?

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.580
How are things in Mito?

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.950
You look better than I thought.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:57.980
They're worried about Ueno, and told me
to tell you to take care of yourself.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:00.790
So I figured I should do anything what I could,
like stopping some bullets if possible.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:05.960
I understand where you're coming from, Tatsu,
but you need to understand my position, too.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.090
What was the point of
my negotiations with Saigo?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:14.020
But either way a war will begin.
You're sure of it, right?

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:21.770
We both served the previous Shogun.
What would you do if you were me?

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:28.130
Surely, at the beginning the majority of the
people in Edo were supportive of the Shogitai.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:37.180
However, it was also true that opposition grew as
they began to requisition money, food and labor.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.960
Heigoro Uekiya's Resident in Sendagaya

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.550
Akizuki.

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.240
Yes.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.340
He's here again.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.920
What?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.910
"He"?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.310
That's right.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:11.850
Okita?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.000
That's him...

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:26.940
I won't let you get away!

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:29.640
Okita!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.480
I'm sorry...

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.350
I'm okay now.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.020
Okita...

00:14:59.100 --> 00:14:59.930
I see...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:05.100
Just like I thought, Commander Kondo was...

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:10.970
I read it in the newspaper on the way here...
It happened at the end of the last month.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:31.870
Toshi... The Vice Chief
has headed north with Otori.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.740
I heard that Harada has joined with the Shogitai.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:40.210
And look at me... the only one who...
I'm so pathetic...

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:44.380
At least I want to be the one
who decides where I die!

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:49.280
This must be how Sakamoto felt when he died,
working towards realizing his ambition.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.330
I see.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.160
Yo isn't here, huh?

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.100
And you don't even know where he went?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.200
No.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.040
If I remember correctly, Akizuki-sama
was Sakamoto-sama's...

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.500
Bodyguard.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:11.340
That's right. But I guess no one
could predict what would happen.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.440
I didn't know what to expect
at the very beginning, but...

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:21.710
Oh? So you came here to kill me?

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.810
You've got the same eyes!

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:27.250
The eyes I had when I went to kill Katsu-sensei!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.160
Come on. Have a seat!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.590
Have a drink!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.600
If you just stand there, looking nervous,
you won't be able to kill even a chicken!

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:45.010
What do you think?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:48.170
Why don't you be my bodyguard, Akizuki?

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.740
And, what do you want to know?

00:16:55.050 --> 00:17:00.290
I already know. Did you want to ask me if
it was the Shinsengumi who killed Sakamoto?

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.020
Well, that's...

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:06.230
No! That's definitely not true, Akizuki!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:14.960
I wouldn't be surprised if that was done by
Fushimi Magistrates' Office or the Town Watch.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:17.400
They were chasing Sakamoto,
but failed to arrest him.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.640
But we, the Shinsengumi,
had no grudge against Sakamoto.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.470
I'm aware of that.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.880
That's not what I want to ask you...

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:32.220
Okita-san, do you know of the
Head of the Conqueror?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.390
The Head of the Conqueror?

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.890
The Head is in Kyoto.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:43.160
It was the last fall when
I heard the news from Yojiro.

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.200
However, the Head wasn't there.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:18.600
He continually felt its presence,
but it wasn't there.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.140
I remember that.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:24.540
That's why he became that man's
bodyguard against his will.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.870
"Against his will", huh? That sounds like Yojiro.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:41.290
And two months later, on that night...

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:41.290
15th day of the 11th month, Keio 3

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.060
Oumiya Inn

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:47.290
Suddenly, the presence that had
surrounded that man disappeared,


00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.300
and his Moontear Sword
indicated a different response.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:58.910
I'm from Totsugawa. Is Sakamoto-sensei home?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.150
Sakamoto-sensei, you've got
a visitor from Totsugawa!

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:06.240
OUMIYA
INN

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:32.170
It's gotten to my brain... This isn't good...

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.330
I believed him.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:06.880
There was no way Yo would kill him...
That's just impossible.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.210
I believed him no matter what.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:15.010
After a long and harsh interrogation,
he was released.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:18.880
But he just disappeared without
saying anything to anyone.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:23.250
He must've blamed himself
for not being able to protect him.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:27.160
But I waited for him for a long time

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.860
because I wanted to tell him what Ryo said...

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:31.700
What he said?

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.170
Where the Head went then...

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.540
Wasn't it to the Shinsengumi itself?

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.540
<i>Faithfulness</i>

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:44.710
Then it still has to be there...
That's what I thought.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:48.750
I see... But unfortunately it is not.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:53.690
I've never seen or heard about it
among the team. Not even once.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.060
Dawn of the 15th day of the 5th month, K eio 4

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:27.850
Okita!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.960
I heard that Harada has joined with the Shogitai.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.930
And look at me... the only one who...
I'm so pathetic...

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:42.430
Impossible!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:52.010
Don't die! Don't die, Okita-san!

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:57.080
The Battle of Ueno begins

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>THE</i>
<i>BLACK CAT</i>
<i>CRIES</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:47.800
EPISODE 10
UENO FALLS

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:37.820
The master sent us a new script?!

00:23:37.820 --> 00:23:40.760
Actually what's inside is unbelievable.

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:42.630
He's still alive!

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:45.800
Supposedly both the master and
Akizuki-sama are in Edo.

00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:47.800
Looks like we need to put that on stage
whether we like it or not.

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:50.270
Looks like we need to put that on stage
whether we like it or not.

00:23:47.800 --> 00:24:02.580
UENO FALLS

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:51.640
Leader!

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:54.070
Everyone, get ready right away!

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:57.310
Here comes another revenge drama
of the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe.

00:23:57.310 --> 00:24:00.210
Our next performance is going to be in Edo!
